Ambient TV: Android EGL BT2020_PQ window surface plus SMPTE-2086 metadata when target-trc=pq and
EGL_EXT_gl_colorspace_bt2020_pq + EGL_EXT_surface_SMPTE2086_metadata exist; otherwise a plain SDR surface.

diff --git a/video/out/opengl/context_android.c b/video/out/opengl/context_android.c
